      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "UNHOOKED (2) was in the money last start when second in a Grade 5/6 in 27.93, clocking one of the quickest times on the card and a personal best this course and distance as well. Going well and rates on top. WILD MILLY (1) overcame a check to place in a Grade 4/5 at Northam over 509m latest, finishing a 2.5 lengths second (30.00). Has box 1 this time where she has four wins. This tougher but looks a leading chance again. DODGY BEAR (4) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Stan Monelli (27.76) in a Grade 5/6. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Boasts two wins from three starts out of this box. Expected to be in this for a long way. BLUE DENIM (5) is in the mix despite missing out at this track last time.",
